      <![CDATA[<h1>HarmonyOS 简介</h1><hr><h2 id="什么是-HarmonyOS">什么是 HarmonyOS</h2><p>随着万物互联时代的开启，应用的设备底座将从几十亿手机扩展到数百亿IoT设备。全新的全场景设备体验，正深入改变消费者的使用习惯。 同时应用开发者也面临设备底座从手机单设备到全场景多设备的转变，全场景多设备的全新底座，为消费者带来万物互联时代更为高效、便捷的体验。</p><p>新的场景同时也带来了新的挑战。开发者不仅需要支持更加多样化的设备，还需要支持跨设备的协作。目前主要面对的挑战如下</p><ul><li>不同设备类型意味着不同的传感器能力、硬件能力、屏幕尺寸、操作系统和开发语言。</li><li>差异化的交互方式。同时跨设备协作也让开发者面临分布式开发带来的各种复杂性。</li><li>若采取传统开发模式，适配和管理工作量将非常巨大。</li></ul><p>HarmonyOS 应用指的是使用 <strong>HarmonyOS SDK</strong> 开发的应用程序，能够在 HarmonyOS 终端设备(如手机、平板等)上运行，具有两种形态</p><ol><li><strong>App</strong>：传统方式的需要安装的App</li><li><strong>元服务</strong>：轻量级、具备免安装、随处可及、服务直达、自由流转等关键特征的元服务</li></ol><h2 id="HarmonyOS-核心技术理念">HarmonyOS 核心技术理念</h2><p>HarmonyOS 具有以下三个核心技术理念</p><ul><li><strong>一次开发、多端部署</strong></li><li><strong>可分可合、自由流转</strong></li><li><strong>统一生态、原生智能</strong></li></ul><p>为了实现这些核心技术优势，HarmonyOS 采用了以下硬件策略</p><ol><li><strong>DevEco Studio</strong>：一站式的 HarmonyOS 应用及元服务开发平台</li><li><strong>ArkTS</strong>：鸿蒙原生应用的开发语言</li><li><strong>ArkUI</strong>：一套构建分布式应用界面的声明式UI开发框架</li><li><strong>AppGallery Connect</strong>：华为应用市场提供的端、云开放能力的合集</li></ol><h1>DevEco Studio 上手</h1><hr><h2 id="安装-DevEco-Studio">安装 DevEco Studio</h2><p>华为使用 DevEco Studio 进行基础开发。前往<a href="https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/deveco-studio/">下载链接</a>后按照相关文档下载相应版本到设备本地。</p><div class="note info flat"><p>首次运行 DevEco Studio 时，若出现 <code>Import DevEco Studio Settings</code> 弹窗，请选择 <code>Do not import settings</code> 后单击 <code>OK</code>。</p></div><h2 id="创建第一个-ArkTS-工程">创建第一个 ArkTS 工程</h2><ol><li>若首次打开 DevEco Studio，单击 <code>Create Project</code> 创建工程。如果已经打开了一个工程，在菜单栏选择 <code>File &gt; New &gt; Create Project</code> 来创建一个新工程</li><li>选择 <code>Application</code> 应用开发，选择模板 <code>Empty Ability</code>，单击 <code>Next</code> 进行下一步配置</li><li>进入配置工程界面，<code>Compatible SDK</code> 表示兼容的最低 API Version，一般保持默认即可</li><li>单击 <code>Finish</code>，工具会自动生成示例代码和相关资源，等待工程创建完成</li></ol><p>工程同步完成后，在 Project 窗口，单击 <code>entry &gt; src &gt; main &gt; ets &gt; pages</code>，打开 <code>Index.ets</code> 文件。我们将利用文本组件、按钮组件等实现第一个 ArkTS 工程，修改 <code>Index.ets</code> 文件如下：</p><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// Index.ets</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Entry</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Component</span></span><br><span class="line">struct <span class="title class_">Index</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="meta">@State</span> <span class="attr">message</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span> = <span class="string">&#x27;Hello World&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="title function_">build</span>(<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title class_">Row</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="title class_">Column</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="title class_">Text</span>(<span class="variable language_">this</span>.<span class="property">message</span>)</span><br><span class="line">          .<span class="title function_">fontSize</span>(<span class="number">50</span>)</span><br><span class="line">          .<span class="title function_">fontWeight</span>(<span class="title class_">FontWeight</span>.<span class="property">Bold</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 添加按钮，以响应用户onClick事件</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="title class_">Button</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">          <span class="title class_">Text</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Next&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            .<span class="title function_">fontSize</span>(<span class="number">30</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            .<span class="title function_">fontWeight</span>(<span class="title class_">FontWeight</span>.<span class="property">Bold</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">type</span>(<span class="title class_">ButtonType</span>.<span class="property">Capsule</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">margin</span>(&#123;</span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">top</span>: <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line">        &#125;)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">backgroundColor</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;#0D9FFB&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">width</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;40%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">height</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;5%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">      &#125;</span><br><span class="line">      .<span class="title function_">width</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;100%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    .<span class="title function_">height</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;100%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在<strong>编辑窗口右上角的侧边工具栏</strong>，单击 <code>Previewer</code>，打开预览器如下。<br><img src="https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/e6/v3/EHWrMPcwSmq19dj82ZDtqw/zh-cn_image_0000002573853415.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20260421T032019Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=86400&amp;HW-CC-Sign=358774461E4B1212F12F59EBA5BE300F4F8EC82F36FB67681856C051C19C0FE7" alt="预览图"></p><p>接下来，我们创建第二个页面，借助按钮组件实现页面的跳转。</p><ol><li>在 Project 窗口打开 <code>entry &gt; src &gt; main &gt; ets</code>，右键单击 <code>pages</code> 文件夹，选择 <code>New &gt; ArkTS File</code>，命名为 <code>Second.ets</code>。</li><li>在 Project 窗口打开 <code>entry &gt; src &gt; main &gt; resources &gt; base &gt; profile</code>，在 <code>main_pages.json</code> 文件中的 <code>src</code> 下配置第二个页面的路由 <code>pages/Second</code> 如下：</li></ol><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;src&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;pages/Index&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;pages/Second&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li>参照第一个页面，在第二个页面添加组件，并设置其样式如下：</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// Second.ets</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Entry</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Component</span></span><br><span class="line">struct <span class="title class_">Second</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="meta">@State</span> <span class="attr">message</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span> = <span class="string">&#x27;Hi there&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="title function_">build</span>(<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title class_">Row</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="title class_">Column</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="title class_">Text</span>(<span class="variable language_">this</span>.<span class="property">message</span>)</span><br><span class="line">          .<span class="title function_">fontSize</span>(<span class="number">50</span>)</span><br><span class="line">          .<span class="title function_">fontWeight</span>(<span class="title class_">FontWeight</span>.<span class="property">Bold</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="title class_">Button</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">          <span class="title class_">Text</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Back&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            .<span class="title function_">fontSize</span>(<span class="number">30</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            .<span class="title function_">fontWeight</span>(<span class="title class_">FontWeight</span>.<span class="property">Bold</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">type</span>(<span class="title class_">ButtonType</span>.<span class="property">Capsule</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">margin</span>(&#123;</span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">top</span>: <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line">        &#125;)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">backgroundColor</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;#0D9FFB&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">width</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;40%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_">height</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;5%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">      &#125;</span><br><span class="line">      .<span class="title function_">width</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;100%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    .<span class="title function_">height</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;100%&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>页面间的导航可以通过<strong>页面路由 router</strong> 来实现。页面路由 router 根据页面 url 找到目标页面，从而实现跳转。</p><div class="note info flat"><p>如果需要实现更好的转场动效，推荐使用 <strong>Navigation</strong>。</p></div><p>需要给跳转按钮绑定 <strong>onClick 事件</strong>，使得单击按钮时跳转。在 <code>Index.ets</code> 的 <code>.height('5%')</code> 代码段后换行并添加如下内容：</p><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 跳转按钮绑定onClick事件，单击时跳转到第二页</span></span><br><span class="line">.<span class="title function_">onClick</span>(<span class="function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">info</span>(<span class="string">`Succeeded in clicking the &#x27;Next&#x27; button.`</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment">// 获取UIContext</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">uiContext</span>: <span class="title class_">UIContext</span> = <span class="variable language_">this</span>.<span class="title function_">getUIContext</span>();</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> router = uiContext.<span class="title function_">getRouter</span>();</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment">// 跳转到第二页</span></span><br><span class="line">  router.<span class="title function_">pushUrl</span>(&#123; <span class="attr">url</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;pages/Second&#x27;</span> &#125;).<span class="title function_">then</span>(<span class="function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">info</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Succeeded in jumping to the second page.&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  &#125;).<span class="title function_">catch</span>(<span class="function">(<span class="params"><span class="attr">err</span>: <span class="title class_">BusinessError</span></span>) =&gt;</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">error</span>(<span class="string">`Failed to jump to the second page. Code is <span class="subst">$&#123;err.code&#125;</span>, message is <span class="subst">$&#123;err.message&#125;</span>`</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;)</span><br><span class="line">&#125;)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>同理，需要给 <code>Second.ets</code>页面绑定按钮跳转，<code>.height('5%')</code> 代码段后换行并添加如下内容：</p><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.<span class="title function_">onClick</span>(<span class="function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">info</span>(<span class="string">`Succeeded in clicking the &#x27;Back&#x27; button.`</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment">// 获取UIContext</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">uiContext</span>: <span class="title class_">UIContext</span> = <span class="variable language_">this</span>.<span class="title function_">getUIContext</span>();</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> router = uiContext.<span class="title function_">getRouter</span>();</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">try</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 返回第一页</span></span><br><span class="line">    router.<span class="title function_">back</span>()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">info</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Succeeded in returning to the first page.&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  &#125; <span class="keyword">catch</span> (err) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">let</span> code = (err <span class="keyword">as</span> <span class="title class_">BusinessError</span>).<span class="property">code</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">let</span> message = (err <span class="keyword">as</span> <span class="title class_">BusinessError</span>).<span class="property">message</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">error</span>(<span class="string">`Failed to return to the first page. Code is <span class="subst">$&#123;code&#125;</span>, message is <span class="subst">$&#123;message&#125;</span>`</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>此时，打开 <code>Index.ets</code> 文件并刷新预览器，应该有以下效果。<br><img src="https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/d2/v3/Hj_Al2iWRSCWdc8qjFPg7Q/zh-cn_image_0000002543213504.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20260421T032019Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=86400&amp;HW-CC-Sign=42E1EBF8F31E737FF767B30B16F5BA035A7507268D3A3D166B4A5ACF33C30A00" alt="跳转预览"></p><h2 id="预览器-Previewer">预览器 Previewer</h2><p>右侧栏中的 <code>Previewer</code> 称作<strong>预览器</strong>。预览器支持 ArkTS/JS 应用/元服务的实时预览和动态预览。</p><ul><li>实时预览：在开发界面 UI 代码过程中，如果添加或删除了 UI 组件，只需 <code>Ctrl+S</code> 进行保存，然后预览器就会立即刷新预览结果。如果修改了组件的属性，则预览器会实时刷新预览结果，达到极速预览的效果。</li><li>动态预览：在预览器界面，可以在预览器中操作应用/元服务的界面交互动作，如单击、跳转、滑动等。与应用/元服务运行在真机设备上的界面交互体验一致。</li></ul><ol><li>页面预览：在工程 <code>.ets</code> 文件头部添加 <code>@Entry</code> 实现</li><li>组件预览：在组件前添加 <code>@Preview</code> 实现。单个源文件中最多可使用10个 <code>@Preview</code></li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Preview</span>(&#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">title</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;ContentTable&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Component</span></span><br><span class="line">struct <span class="title class_">ContentTablePreview</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="title function_">build</span>(<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title class_">Flex</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="title class_">ContentTable</span>(&#123; <span class="attr">foodItem</span>: <span class="title function_">getDefaultFoodData</span>() &#125;)</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="使用模拟器-真机">使用模拟器/真机</h2><p>模拟器是开发和调试 HarmonyOS 应用/元服务的便捷工具，也是运行在 Mac 或 Windows 电脑上的虚拟机应用，会使用电脑的硬件资源，包括CPU、内存和网络连接等。在部分场合下，使用模拟器进行开发调试是一个更优的选择。</p><div class="note info flat"><p>DevEco Studio 6.1.0 Beta2 版本起，其会自动生成预置模拟器供使用。模拟器和真机的区别<a href="https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/training/course/slightMooc/C101717494752698457?choosedChapterIds=f779c86e37b045c8bd4509c371f53418,247cf1a2a7c44b208b196e4cc8fdb8ab,9e734059fe244e56b2f210421f0af2df">点此处查看</a>。</p></div><p>如果想要使用真机进行项目运行，可以按照以下操作进行</p><ol><li>将搭载 HarmonyOS 系统的真机与电脑连接</li><li>进入 <code>File &gt; Project Structure... &gt; Project &gt; Signing Configs</code> 界面，勾选<code>Automatically generate signature</code>，即可完成签名</li></ol><div class="note info flat"><p>如果未登录，请先单击 <code>Sign In</code> 进行登录，然后自动完成签名。</p></div><ol start="3"><li>在编辑窗口右上角的工具栏，单击绿色运行按钮，发现跳转功能可以实现。</li></ol><p>至此，第一个 HarmonyOS 项目已构建完毕！</p><h1>ArkTS 语法基础</h1><hr><h2 id="基础内容">基础内容</h2><p>TypeScript 是在 JavaScript 基础上通过添加类型定义扩展而来的，ArkTS 则是 TypeScript 的进一步扩展。因此 ArkTS 对于已有 TypeScript 和 JavaScript 语言基础的开发者较为友好。</p><div class="note default simple"><p>声明</p></div><p>ArkTS 通过声明引入变量、常量、类型和函数。</p><ol><li>使用关键字 <code>let</code> 声明的变量可以在程序执行期间具有不同的值。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">hi</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span> = <span class="string">&#x27;hello&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">hi = <span class="string">&#x27;hello, world&#x27;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li>使用关键字 <code>const</code> 声明的常量为只读类型，<strong>只能被赋值一次</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">const</span> <span class="attr">hello</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span> = <span class="string">&#x27;hello&#x27;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li>如果变量或常量的声明包含初始值，无需显式指定类型，这由自动推断保证</li></ol><div class="note default simple"><p>类型</p></div><ol><li><strong>number 类型</strong>：任何整数和浮点数都可以被赋给此类型的变量，且支持多种表示形式。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> n1 = <span class="number">3</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> n2 = -<span class="number">0xF1A7</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> n3 = <span class="number">0.51</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> n4 = <span class="number">1e2</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="note info flat"><p>number 类型在表示大整数时会造成精度丢失，此时可以使用 <code>bigint</code>。</p></div><ol start="2"><li><strong>boolean 类型</strong>：由 true 和 false 两个逻辑值组成。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">isDone</span>: <span class="built_in">boolean</span> = <span class="literal">false</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li><strong>string 类型</strong>：表示字符序列，可以使用转义字符来表示字符。字符串字面量由单引号（'）或双引号（&quot;）之间括起来的零个或多个字符组成。字符串字面量还有一特殊形式，是用反向单引号（`）括起来的模板字面量。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> s1 = <span class="string">&#x27;Hello, world!\n&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> s2 = <span class="string">&#x27;this is a string&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> a = <span class="string">&quot;Success&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> s3 = <span class="string">`The result is <span class="subst">$&#123;a&#125;</span>`</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="4"><li><strong>void 类型</strong>：用于指定函数没有返回值。</li><li><strong>Object 类型</strong>：所有<strong>引用类型</strong>的基类型。任何值，包括基本类型的值，都可以直接被赋给 Object 类型的变量。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">o1</span>: <span class="title class_">Object</span> = <span class="string">&#x27;Alice&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">o2</span>: <span class="title class_">Object</span> = [<span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>];</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">o3</span>: <span class="title class_">Object</span> = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">o4</span>: <span class="built_in">object</span> = [<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span>];</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="6"><li><strong>array 类型</strong>：数组，是由可赋值给数组声明中指定的元素类型的数据组成的对象<strong>数组中第一个元素的索引为0</strong>。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">names</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span>[] = [<span class="string">&#x27;Alice&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;Bob&#x27;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;Carol&#x27;</span>];</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="7"><li><strong>enum 类型</strong>：枚举类型，是预先定义的一组命名值的值类型，其中命名值又称为枚举常量。</li></ol><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">enum</span> <span class="title class_">ColorSet</span> &#123; <span class="title class_">Red</span>, <span class="title class_">Green</span>, <span class="title class_">Blue</span> &#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">c</span>: <span class="title class_">ColorSet</span> = <span class="title class_">ColorSet</span>.<span class="property">Red</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="8"><li><p><strong>Union 类型</strong>：联合类型，是由多个类型组合成的引用类型。联合类型包含了变量可能的所有类型。</p></li><li><p><strong>Aliases 类型</strong>：为匿名类型提供名称，或为已定义的类型提供替代名称。</p></li></ol><div class="note default simple"><p>运算符</p></div><p>ArkTS 的运算符使用与 C 语言相似，也可<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Expressions_and_operators">前往此处</a>。这里介绍几个特殊的运算符。</p><div class="flink"><div class="flink-name">参考链接</div><div class="flink-list">      <div class="flink-list-item">        <a href="https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/" title="华为Developers" target="_blank">          <div class="flink-item-icon">            <img class="no-lightbox" src="/img/body/huawei.png" onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src="/img/friend_404.gif"' alt="华为Developers" />          </div>          <div class="flink-item-name">华为Developers</div>          <div class="flink-item-desc" title="Make it possible together">Make it possible together</div>        </a>      </div></div></div>]]>
